course: dictionary
lesson: 15978
title: Upholstery: the soft covers on furniture
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Upholstery is the soft part of a sofa, armchair or car seat. It is the padding, the springs and the cloth or leather you can see and touch on the outside.
explain: «The car's upholstery was stained with juice after the picnic.» The stain is on the seats, so upholstery must mean the soft covers and padding on the seats. Check it by swapping in your meaning: the soft covers were stained, and that still makes sense.
explain: Upholstery can also mean the job of making and covering furniture. «Dad is learning upholstery at college.» He is learning a craft, not learning about a sofa he is sitting on. A person who does this job is called an upholsterer.
fact: Upholstery means the soft padding, springs and cloth or leather that cover sofas, armchairs and car seats.
fact: Upholstery can also mean the craft or job of making and covering furniture in this way.
fact: «Upholstery» is a noun, and it is usually uncountable, so we say «some upholstery», not «an upholstery».
fact: Materials used in upholstery include foam, fabric and leather.
fact: An upholsterer is the person who makes and covers furniture.
exercise: «The car seats have grey upholstery that is easy to wipe clean.» What is upholstery here? | The engine that makes the car go | *The soft cover and padding on the seats | The wheels on the road | The windows and the glass
exercise: «Dad is learning upholstery at college, so he can make armchairs himself.» What does upholstery mean here? | A sort of sports game | A kind of school trip | *The craft of making and covering furniture | A type of cooking
exercise: Which person makes and covers furniture? | A plumber | A baker | A gardener | *An upholsterer
test: Tom says upholstery is only the cloth. Is he right? | No, it is a kind of food | Yes, the cloth is all it is | *No, it also includes the padding and springs under the cloth | Yes, and it is only for beds
test: «The old sofa's upholstery was torn, so we chose a new blue fabric.» What was torn? | *The soft cover and padding on the sofa | The wooden legs of the sofa | The rug on the floor | The lamp next to the sofa
exam: In «The car's upholstery needs cleaning after the picnic», what needs cleaning? | The engine and the wheels | The road outside | The windows only | *The soft seat covers and padding
